{"server":"tw","storyId":"act17mini_level_act17mini_st04","groupId":"act17mini","stageId":null,"title":"未完成的態度","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act17mini/level_act17mini_st04.txt","sourceHash":"64a5eb40c11bd72fb405c6aea76254019fbd1ddb93dcf1cc8295c1291bdfeddd","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"在薩卡茲的市場上，特立獨行的克倫妮引起了妮芙的注意。死魂靈碎片被克倫妮製作成裝飾禮服的寶石胸針。妮芙跟隨她出城，卻意外遇到前來送貨的莫斯提馬。在改進了禮服的設計後，克倫妮發現自己不再需要這枚胸針，於是將它送給妮芙。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，埃米？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"已經過了兩天了，有什麼新進展嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我找到好幾個了！嗯，其實也就兩個……不過你放心，應該很快就能結束！怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"沒關係，也就是老傢伙突然想起來關心這件事，過來催我幾句。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"本來以為這些碎片會把卡茲戴爾搞得天翻地覆的，現在看來還好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"沒人因為這件事去敲軍事委員會的門，我們也沒檢測出來什麼異常。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（小聲）因為事情都被我碰上了啊，哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"總之，你按照自己的節奏來就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"嗯，就這樣，記得安全第一，遇上搞不定的事記得來找我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，沒問題，謝謝埃米~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米做事還是這麼周到，我也得快點了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想好吃什麼了沒有？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？哦，對不起，我這就挑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就嚐嚐這個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼新食物嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是烤麵團啊，你又不是第一次在我這裡吃。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，是不是變好吃了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"比以前有嚼勁了，還有點……甜味？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？可能是進的料比以前好了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近回來的人越來越多，有管道買點便宜的好料，麵團也就更香了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，以後還需要我去幫忙砍價嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用了，之前一個來我這裡吃東西的僱傭兵，幫我聯絡了一家更好的供應商，他們價格蠻合適的，也好交流，就不麻煩你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就太好了！再這樣下去您這裡是不是可以做維多利亞那裡的白麵包了呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這貪吃鬼，白麵包有什麼好吃的，下次找個機會，過來吃烤獸肉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的嗎？！烤獸肉……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能再給我三個烤麵團嗎？我想帶走路上吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，稍等呀，我拿剛出爐的給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿嘿，謝謝您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼哼~這兩天忙了這麼多事，也該犒勞一下自己了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……沒有什麼比舒服的填飽肚子更幸福的事了——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙一眼就瞥見了那個薩卡茲。當然，她並不是故意的。\n無論是誰，只要路過這裡，都會被那道身影吸引。\n拄著手杖，戴著禮帽，昂著頭顱，一動不動地站在那裡。\n在一個大部分人都蓬頭垢面、衣冠不整的地方，這樣的人實在是太稀奇了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來，你要的麵團。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，好，謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"第一次見到她嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我以前好像沒見過這樣的……人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也不是一開始就這樣的，不知道什麼時候發了瘋，離開卡茲戴爾出去闖蕩了一陣，回來以後就變這樣了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦……話是這麼說，但是，很好看啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好看有什麼用，往那一站就是一天，什麼都賣不出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她也賣烤麵團嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那倒不是。她會用那些廢料做首飾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有些奇怪的玩意，像是透明玻璃巫術球，裡面放個卡茲戴爾的模型，還有印著奇怪圖案的杯子——全都又貴又容易碎，呆子才買。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說還有什麼擺件和雕塑，那些就更屬於沒人買的玩意了。平常用不上，賣得還那麼貴，也不知道她是怎麼想的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"周邊那些和她關係稍微好一點的都勸過她，但她就是聽不進去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每天能看到一個穿得漂漂亮亮的人在街上，總歸也不是件壞事嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是希望她能賺點糧食養活自己……要是餓死在我這烤麵團的攤位前面，那豈不是鬧笑話了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，您說的也有些道理……我該走了，回頭見~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"街邊攤販","speakerId":"avg_npc_934_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見小妮芙，下次多介紹點朋友來光顧我這小攤啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"忘不了的，拜拜~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……吃飽喝足，該繼續工作了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真好看啊……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（是維多利亞的款式嗎？用料一看就很貴。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（還有那枚鑲著紫紅色寶石的胸針……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（等忙完埃米的事情，拿到報酬，就去她的攤位上逛逛吧！）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？在這裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼可能，剛剛還沒有的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"到底在哪裡？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"鑲著紫紅色寶石的胸針……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙猛地反應過來，看向那個無人光顧的小攤。\n可那裡已經沒人了，戴著禮帽的攤主早已收拾好貨物，消失在了卡茲戴爾的人流中。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米，你快接啊，有急事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這、這該怎麼辦啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是真的是因為被附身了才做成首飾隨身帶著，那位女士她……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"來不及了，我得先跟上去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini01_katzdalesquare_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您好，您知道，剛剛在這裡擺攤的女士去哪了嗎？就是穿著禮服、戴著禮帽的那位……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？什麼是禮服？嗯……就是穿得很奇怪、東西沒人買的那位！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是往這個方向去了嗎？好的，謝……烤麵團？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是在街角那一頭的小攤上買的，我送你一個吧，要是覺得好吃可以去那裡買！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡都快到城市出口了，她來這裡做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"探測裝置……反應很微弱，但應該就在這裡沒錯了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我要仔細找找。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"倉庫？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是住在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不對，哪有穿那麼華貴卻住在這種地方的道理。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是說……是那枚死魂靈碎片？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米聯繫不上，珀耳去其他地方找碎片了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快動動你的腦子，妮芙，一定有辦法的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"催眠、心理暗示、源石技藝……哪怕硬搶呢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好，女士，找我有什麼事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不好意思，請讓我再想想……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說了算，女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您、您好？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克倫妮·“雅仕”·曼提爾，很榮幸見到你，有什麼能為你效勞的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……您能把胸針賣給我嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為，因為……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為我很喜歡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很抱歉，女士，它是非賣品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"況且，它和你的衣服並不相稱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這裡有更好的點綴，能與玫瑰相符的絕配，如果你需要的話，我可以將那枚給你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我只想要這枚。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙緊盯著對方的眼睛，垂在身側的手指以特殊的頻率輕輕晃動著，在空氣中畫出一個個複雜的圖形。\n這些圖案倒映在克倫妮的眼瞳中，卻在眨眼時被輕輕拭去，沒能如預料那般深入心靈。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我恐怕不能如你所願了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在找到更好的替代品前，我不會放棄這枚寶石。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我有些要緊事，就不招待了。請回吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（輕輕揮動法杖）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（低聲吟唱）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請您稍等片刻，聽聽我的願望吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙的法術從她的意志中飛掠而出，輕柔地落在了克倫妮身上。\n一秒，兩秒……\n目標越走越遠。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……沒效果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈碎片就被她戴在身上，想要繞開死魂靈去觸碰她的內心，的確不是一件容易的事……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真要用那個蠢辦法嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對不起！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，笞心魔小姐，我趕時間，請別擋路。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……欸？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米，趕緊回個話吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"埃米！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技藝用不上，打也打不過，搶也搶不動……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她不是個小販嗎！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先跟著吧，妮芙，就當看看先祖想要帶著她去哪裡了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算出事了，也好第一時間把具體情況告訴埃米……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她總不會一路跑到城外去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡已經是城區邊緣了，她到底要去哪裡呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難道真的要出城？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那我應該可以和在城門值班的巫妖們聯繫一下，埃米給過我聯繫方式，他們一定可以攔住碎片的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，人呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會吧？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_L1"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙看到，克倫妮打開手提箱，從裡面取出了一架簡易滑翔翼。\n克倫妮一手用手杖鈎住滑翔翼骨架，一手抓住手提箱把手，以她特有的筆挺身姿掛在滑翔翼下方，逐漸遠離了卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"49_g2_kazdelstreet_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"死魂靈碎片連這樣的事都能做到嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……我還是先……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，埃米那個傢伙靠不住的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，要不還是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"看著漸漸飄遠的滑翔翼，妮芙躊躇了好久，但最終，還是下定了決心。\n她將鑰索末端插入法杖上的鎖孔，鑰索崩斷，化作了繞身的鑰匙。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙取出一把鑰匙，打開腰間的包，鑰匙頓時分成兩群。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一群接在法杖上，如旋翼般快速轉動。\n一群被妮芙踩在腳下，減輕重力。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"38_g20_skyblue_L1"},{"type":"narration","text":"滯留在空中是一種很奇妙的體驗。\n順著風飄向遠方，看著熟悉的事物漸漸變小、變小。\n直到看清卡茲戴爾的整個輪廓，看著城市的稜角在暖陽中變得模糊。\n然後，迎著微風與暖意——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"在分心的瞬間向下墜去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗚啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用我的手帕擦擦汗吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊……謝……謝謝……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從來沒見過你這麼莽撞的人。那些源石技藝，你自己都沒有用熟練，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"確……確實……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是您剛剛飛過來拉了我一把，我真要直接摔地上了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝您的手帕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，不客氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您每次離開城市都是這樣下來的嗎……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快捷、便利、優雅，多麼美妙的方法，靈感來自謝拉格的雪山纜車。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您去過謝拉格？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終有一天我會去的，不過現在，看看報紙上的圖畫就已足夠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去吧，小笞心魔。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是個奇怪的先祖……他就這麼著急離開卡茲戴爾嗎？還非得帶上克倫妮一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，已經完全沒有訊號了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"自求多福吧，妮芙。你的大冒險要開始了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，終於停下來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"看樣子不是要直接離開卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"narration","text":"遠遠地，妮芙看到克倫妮深深吸了一口氣，然後大聲唸出了一句奇怪的……咒語？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"<i>“出來吧，苦難陳述者！”</i>"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"“苦難陳述者”？那是什麼，咒語嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"可能是魔王名諱吧，古老的魔王有這種名諱好像也沒什麼問題。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如您所願，老朋友。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵，好久不見啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"薩、薩科塔？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這是他的計劃嗎，還有薩科塔接應？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他究竟要幹什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我看到你了，小笞心魔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有必要躲在石頭後面，出來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的小學徒這麼見外嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那位女士不是我的學徒，可能是有些誤會吧，她一直在跟著我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果你繼續戴著這枚胸針到處亂逛的話，我猜你很快就會被通緝的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"感謝你的建議，莫斯提馬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先讓我看一下我訂的貨物，好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如你所願。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"莫斯提馬輕輕一抬，把箱子送到了兩人面前。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你訂購的貨物——三匹大炎特等柔光綢，送到了，驗一下貨吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是……這就是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能感覺到……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這抗拒觸摸的柔滑，這顯現諸色的潔白……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……看來他真的要離開卡茲戴爾啊，連物資都準備好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，那個薩科塔怎麼不見了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你好啊，小笞心魔，今天天氣不錯呢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你別過來，我、我是術師，我源石技藝很強的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可太巧了，你看，我也是術師，我們還算是半個同行不是嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可你是……我是……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，你也是講道理的人，不會無緣無故攻擊我這個手無寸鐵的信使吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就當默認了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克倫妮驗貨還需要些時間，我就在這裡吹吹風，偷下懶，不會打擾到你的。怎麼樣？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，你是個信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"企鵝物流，使命必達~"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要吃顆拉特蘭的糖果嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝……那這個給你，喏。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"卡茲戴爾的烤麵團，可惜已經冷了……熱的時候更好吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我就不客氣了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你和克倫妮……是怎麼認識的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這可是客戶隱私，而且你確定要聽一個薩科塔講故事嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說不定我會在謊言裡編織一個陷阱把你的靈魂騙進去哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……請說吧，我能判斷真假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然大家都把薩科塔說得很可怕，可……畢竟你沒用銃對著我掃射，也沒有把我的角掰下來掛在腰間當戰利品。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，好。那就讓我自言自語幾句吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……從哪裡說起好呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幾年前，在烏薩斯送貨的時候，我遇上了一個薩卡茲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽說是在家裡待不下去了，出來闖蕩，剛剛找到了自己想走的路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"烏薩斯對許多東西的管控都很嚴格，所以那個薩卡茲就經常委託我們幫她送些東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"克倫妮小姐在烏薩斯做設計師嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"設計師？呵呵，烏薩斯人願意讓一個薩卡茲做助理就算是大發善心了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實那是個由薩卡茲創建的品牌，但在烏薩斯太過流行了，經常被當作烏薩斯的本土企業。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，你眼前那個把布料當性命的人最早也是這麼認為的，她就這樣在烏薩斯碰了一鼻子灰，最終繞了一圈回到了你們這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她應該是賺夠錢才回來的吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"錢？呵呵，她恐怕和有錢沒什麼關係。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從某種程度上來說，你見到的，就是她的全部了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬，貨沒問題！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那為什麼她還要買布料呢？我到過她住的地方，也見過她周圍的人，她為了買這些名貴的布料，似乎連飯都吃不飽了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"難道她提前預見了大熔爐會爆炸，想讓死魂靈附著在那些布料上？不行，完全說不通啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，我好像聽到了點不得了的消息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然不知道你在說些什麼，但我們該過去了，來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還有什麼要吩咐的嗎，克倫妮？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多謝，莫斯提馬，一路過來辛苦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪裡的話，我也只是收錢辦事罷了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"後續的話，我還想要些薩爾貢的布料，還是像以前那樣先付全款給你嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以是可以，不過抱歉，以後你大概不需要我來送這些東西了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……怎麼了，你的公司變更營運策略了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不不不，不要誤會。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的意思是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"以後這些東西在卡茲戴爾就可以買，沒有必要找企鵝物流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近來你們卡茲戴爾的商隊數量翻了好幾番，羅德島的傢伙們也給薩卡茲搭了好幾次線。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"過不了多久，你們那裡大概就會有固定售賣進口貨物的地方了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也就是說……我的卡茲戴爾紀念品也可以賣出去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"水晶球、杯子之類的旅遊紀念品……和你在別的國家見到的沒什麼兩樣，不過出自卡茲戴爾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，誰會想來卡茲戴爾旅遊呢？這裡似乎也沒什麼好觀光的……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實我還滿想進卡茲戴爾逛逛的，看看你們的魂靈熔爐，你們的街道，還有那個“知識聖殿”……是有這個地方的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，可惜我沒這個機會。你的點子聽起來有點意思，到時候和那些商人聊聊吧，或許他們真的願意買些“旅遊紀念品”拿回去炫耀。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我記下了，謝謝。還有你，這位笞心魔……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫我妮芙就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，妮芙女士，我們該回家了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。那……再見，薩科塔信使小姐！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再見，下次有什麼需要記得聯繫企鵝物流哦，聯繫方式找克倫妮要就行。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呼……你是不是也該露面了，“苦難陳述者”，還是“烈火爆炸狂”？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……你瘋了嗎，為了送貨跑到卡茲戴爾來？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要是被薩卡茲抓住，你根本沒機會活著離開這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老主顧的單，不接不太好啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你難道在擔心我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……監管你是我的工作，現在跟我回去，立刻，馬上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，這荒郊野外的我能逃到哪去呢，不然，去卡茲戴爾玩一天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（舉起武器）……走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真難勸啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到寒舍。"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙和克倫妮逛了一天，最終回到了她們初次交談的倉庫。\n妮芙本以為這是死魂靈操控著克倫妮躲開人群的藏身之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（真的是住人的地方啊……）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（一張床，一個小工作台，幾件掛著的衣服，一個放雜物的角落。基本的傢俱都沒有幾件……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從某種程度上來說，你見到的，就是她的全部了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_windows"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請隨意些，把這裡當作自己的家就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"需要幫忙嗎，克倫妮小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用，我自己來就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您買的這種布料，很貴吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大概幾個月的伙食？這不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔，這裡不應該用胸針，用布料做一根飾帶來搭襯的話……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"妮芙女士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想要這枚胸針，是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸？對的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，那不是——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拿去吧，我不需要它了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沉重的凝滯感從胸針上傳來，讓妮芙不禁打了個寒顫。她趕緊把那枚被當成寶石的碎片丟進手提箱中。\n從始至終，這枚死魂靈碎片除了附在胸針上之外，好像什麼都沒有做。\n沒有控制什麼奇怪的造物，也沒有在人群中引起爭端。\n當他落在手心裡時，自己甚至還感受到了一些氣憤和無奈，就像是……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……對馱獸彈琴？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，沒關係，只是腦子裡冒出來些奇怪的想法……您好些了嗎，克倫妮小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"謝謝你的關心，我一直很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（語氣好像和之前沒什麼區別，真的恢復了嗎？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼需要我幫忙的，儘管和我說就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……妮芙女士……其實我有個不情之請。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還是叫我妮芙吧，不用那麼客氣啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，妮芙，能過來一下嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"妮芙看清了克倫妮工作台上的衣服，那似乎是件禮服，但卻並不是克倫妮的尺寸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"試試看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我嗎？"},{"type":"narration","text":"克倫妮拿出皮尺，快速地在妮芙身上比劃了幾下，嘴裡嘀咕了幾個不同的數字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"應該是合身的，試穿一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這件衣服是不是很貴重？我怕……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，它還沒做好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那，我就試著穿穿看了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"好、好看嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"很美。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"尺寸合適嗎，袖口緊不緊，有沒有哪裡覺得彆扭？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，很合適……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這件衣服，是為您的某位朋友做的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，這是送給我自己的禮物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"製作它是我的心願，很可惜，我還沒能完成它。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得它已經很完美了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"還差得遠呢。袖口還要修，裝飾還得調，它還很粗糙……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可以脫下來了，妮芙，謝謝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喔，好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可您為什麼要做一件自己不能穿的衣服呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為它的出現給我的人生指了一個方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想過與眾不同的生活，但我又熱愛這座城市。所以我試過許多方法來博取人們的注意，都是些薩卡茲的老套路，你應該很了解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最終的結果就是，我被趕出了卡茲戴爾，在荒野上流浪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有人為我提供了一份在烏薩斯的卑微的工作，原本我只是抱著能活下去就好的心態去試試。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但後來，我發現自己很適合那些靈巧的工作，更重要的是，我得到了一份設計師的手稿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個卡茲戴爾的薩卡茲設計師，卡茲戴爾的，設計師，我從沒想到這些詞能夠放在一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那份手稿上記錄的，就是這件衣服嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。手稿損毀得很厲害，許多訊息都不見了，除了寫了一半的“為了AM”和這件禮服的概念，其他的什麼都沒有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我總覺得，裡面包含著一份我從沒感受過的情感。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了了解它，我學了製衣，還做了許多其他的小玩意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正巧，從前的卡茲戴爾忘記了我，所以我回來了，用一個新身分回到了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和我一樣，卡茲戴爾也變了不少，它變得寬容了。連我這樣的異類，也能擁有一方舞台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以您才會做那些賣不出去的東西？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那可是旅遊紀念品，總有一天，卡茲戴爾也會接待來自全泰拉的遊客——我是這樣相信的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然只是心血來潮試著做做看，但別的地方有的，卡茲戴爾也能有，而且不一定就比他們的差。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"無論是一件時尚的衣服，還是一套旅遊紀念品，甚至是……一種生活的方式，對美的追求。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您想得也太遠啦……卡茲戴爾變成旅遊景點這種事，我在夢裡也見不到呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過最近城裡確實變了不少，來來往往，熱鬧了很多，和以前都不一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"您看前幾天夜裡的煙火，多漂亮啊，說不定大熔爐也是因為太熱鬧、太高興，才炸出這麼好看的煙火。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"怎麼了，妮芙？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"用不到你啦，本來收集碎片的時候出了些問題，現在已經搞定了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"那就好。今天我在幫老頭……咳，協助老師進行一些命結方面的研究，意識不在這裡，不好意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒關係，城裡差不多都檢查過一遍了，就剩一片新蓋的生活區還沒去。說不定明天我就搞定了，先幫我準備報酬吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"弄好了直接來拿就好，不會欠你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"埃芒加德","speakerId":"avg_npc_869_1","isRemote":true,"text":"早點休息吧，再見。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，再見埃米。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那我也不打擾您了，克倫妮小姐，有什麼事的話記得來找我，這是我的聯繫方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"克倫妮","speakerId":"avg_npc_1453_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，謝謝。晚安，妮芙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"晚安~"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"52_mini02_katzdalesquare_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈……好累……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早上買的烤麵團，結果自己都沒吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊嗚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔……回家熱一熱的話，一定會更好吃吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"珀耳，你怎麼找到我的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天走了城門，又從城牆上飛下去，這麼顯眼，那些情報販子都聊了半天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有什麼發現嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒有，軍事委員會的駐紮區附近和聚居地都沒有碎片的影子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這邊，應該是有所收穫，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你看！今天我找到的這個碎片很好看的，像寶石一樣！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是大熔爐裡頭燒出來的玻璃塊吧，顏色的確很獨特。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，把這塊碎片交給我的人，也很獨特呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過今天實在太睏了，跑了一天，又累又餓，哈啊……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快回去休息吧，反正我們要檢查的地方就只剩下最後一片生活區了，想辦法明天搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看你睏得都要撞牆了……唉，還是我送送你吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"珀耳","speakerId":"avg_4147_mitm_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別睡著啊，路上你剛好跟我講講那個“獨特的人”是怎麼回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯……今天，我去集市上買了一個……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"妮芙","speakerId":"avg_4146_nymph_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一個烤麵團，好香好香……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
